'[Mission Dialog]'

'[info]'
Title = "Valiant Soldiers";
briefing = "Valiant Soldiers
Date: October 3, 1993 - 1800 hours
Location:  Mogadishu, Somalia

Situation:
There's been another Black Hawk shot down. Super Six-Four was hit by an RPG and crashed south of the target building. We also have men separated from their units. Collect a team and make your way to the second crash site.";
briefing2 = "<cFC8932>Valiant Soldiers<-co>
FRAGO: 3 TFR  REF: OPORD 10-93 TFR Date Time: 031800 October 93 

1. <ucFC8932>Situation<-uco>
Another Black Hawk, Super Six Four, was hit by an RPG and went down south of the target building. We can't get them on the radio. A group of Rangers and the C-SAR have secured the first site, but there is not a second C-SAR available. We have men scattered throughout the area radioing in trying to link up.
      <cFC8932>Weather:<-co>  Clear, hot.
      <cFC8932>Terrain:<-co>  Urban - City center.
      <cFC8932>Enemy:<-co>  Estimated 500 Habr Gedir militia equipped with small arms, grenades and RPG's. Technicals w/ 50 caliber mounted weapons.
      <cFC8932>Friendly:<-co>  None

2. <ucFC8932>Mission<-uco> 
      <cFC8932>Who:<-co> Delta 5
      <cFC8932>What:<-co> Move by foot, link up with scattered units, move to crash site.
      <cFC8932>When:<-co> Immediately.

3. <ucFC8932>Execution<-uco>
      <cFC8932>Commanders Intent:<-co>  Link up with scattered Soldiers. Get to 2nd crash site.
      <cFC8932>Concept of Operation:<-co>  Move to the 2nd crash site on foot while linking with any stragglers you can find. Once you have enough firepower, get to that helo before the Habr Gedir capture or kill the survivors.
Coordinating instructions - 

4. <ucFC8932>Service and Support<-uco>
      <cFC8932>Basic Load:<-co>  CAR15/M203, Colt .45, AT-4

5. <ucFC8932>Command and signal<-uco>
	Separated units will be patched into the battle net as they radio in.";

